WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.480 --> 00:00:09.096
Nasolabial folds are a sunken indentation in the skin, so makeup can't erase them entirely.

2
00:00:09.432 --> 00:00:14.400
Unlike a scar with a different skin tone, a wrinkle caused by the skin's contour

3
00:00:14.736 --> 00:00:24.504
can be softened with techniques that make the sunken area appear filled, combined with contouring and hydration, to look much lighter.

4
00:00:24.840 --> 00:00:31.896
A moisture-rich base is layered thinly, several times, so makeup doesn't cake in the crease,

5
00:00:32.232 --> 00:00:40.800
and a hint of fine shimmer brightens the shadow in the fold, creating the illusion that the hollow has filled in.

6
00:00:41.136 --> 00:00:54.120
Shading and highlighting also create a lifted look across the whole face, drawing the eye away from the fold and softening your overall expression.

7
00:00:54.456 --> 00:01:05.160
Thorough hydration at home before the wedding — like moisture masks — helps makeup adhere better on the day for an even better result.

8
00:01:05.496 --> 00:01:09.864
In short, it's less about hiding the fold and more about softening it.
